# Normalize all text files to LF in the repository and in the working tree.
#
# Without this, `core.autocrlf=true` checks files out as CRLF on Windows while
# git stores LF. Prettier defaults to `endOfLine: "lf"`, so `npm run format`
# then fails on every file it checks locally, even ones that were never edited.
# CI runs on ubuntu and checks out LF, so it never saw the problem.
#
# `text=auto` still lets git detect and leave binary files alone.
* text=auto eol=lf
